      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T22:54:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "note: the reason this isn\u0027t working is because the result of asAIBinder holds the memory, but it\u0027s instantly deleted before this second incStrong here, you should put:\n\n```\nsp\u003cAIBinder\u003e binder \u003d accessor-\u003easAIBinder();\nbinder-\u003eincStrong(\u0026ARpc_Accessor_asBinder);\nreturn binder.get(); // client has one implicit refcount\n```",
